  <item>
    <title>007 Yo! Comfy Life |年轻人如何对金钱更有控制感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667d7b09c13b46d76c554901</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667d7b09c13b46d76c554901</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Jun 2024 14:45:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【聊天的二位儿~】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>🎙️毕业GAP了1年的无业游民梻幂：</span></strong></p><p><span>大学base上海，生活费2k+，吃好喝好，险“富于”月光族。</span></p><p><span>毕业后感觉真正触及钱了，开始关注赚钱与储蓄。在县城真的对钱更“有数”了！两个月:1w+收入入账，母亲节给妈妈买礼物花了三四千。账户数额基本原样。</span></p><p><span>存款感受：</span></p><blockquote><p><span>1 对”仅有资产“的掌控感、体会到靠自己的"经济独立"感</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>2 知道自己的消费额度在哪、了解和控制自己的消费水平</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>🎙️蔷薇少女:已经工作5-6年的IT民工</span></strong></p><p><span>base 南京，5月顶级消费17 000块，感觉啥也没玩好，但统计下的数额就是这么恐怖.</span></p><blockquote><p><span>自从开始了“日常开支消减计划”之后，从来没有感觉到如此的自由和对生活如此的有掌控力，是我在过自己喜欢、想要的生活，而不是生活拖着我走、强迫我过那些“被别人定义为好”的生活。</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>【时间线】</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">00:03:07</a>原来一些年轻职场人都用花呗/银行卡记账</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">00:08:26</a>大学生花呗劝退...?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">00:17:20</a>从高档餐厅到自己做美食~</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">00:21:10</a>月月存钱小金库【超实用】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">00:27:50</a>买房——年轻人的赌博</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">00:32:50</a>FIRE:摆脱出卖时间换金钱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">00:40:15</a>上班也是保持可持续性健康生活</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3230">00:53:50</a>超出存钱期的心理预算，不去新疆了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3630">00:60:30</a>原来真幸福感的事不怎么花钱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3752">00:62:32</a>抵抗风险的资金：预备六个月的开销</span></p><p><strong><span>【提到的】</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqVZB2jkdQp2ifjKp9HupXS672yO.png"></figure><ul><li><p><strong><span>Fire（the financial independence, retire early movement）</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span>豆瓣小组：（理财类标签）FIRE生活</span></p><p><span>就是打工人的提前退休探索之道~</span></p><p><em><span>【Last】</span></em></p><p><em><span>祝你活的长久一点~</span></em></p><p><span>ED：Sour Sweets-Joey Pecoraro</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loFmXhajmNT1Q-aQNHKURaescmwR.m4a" length="97060521" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqrLcqlJxKU0P0aQnhjlZo_6Hi9x.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>008 海外IT民工| 外派常驻相当于现代淘金？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6675b4c0b6a841272971f372</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6675b4c0b6a841272971f372</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Jun 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>毕业后一直从事海外IT项目，搬砖五年啦~</span></p><p><span>这五年来认识了形形色色的人，从基层开发到海外运维、海外IT项目销售、技术顾问等等等等</span></p><p><span>最后聊到一位程序员写的书《副业赚钱之道：从0到1打造多元化收入》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">00:01:25</a> &nbsp;行业内部其实很多人都不是写代码的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">00:02:39</a> 软件公司业务：售前、需求调研、开发、交付和运维</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">00:10:34</a> 愿意or抢着去外派的原因：两年赚一套房？!</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">00:16:46</a> 吃香第一条：留学经历or海外工作经验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1183">00:19:43</a> 海外vs国内工作薪资对比</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">00:22:59</a> 在印尼成为销冠的一位玩家</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">00:32:41</a> 程序员的滚雪球做副业之旅</span></p><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2011">00:33:31</a>在每个副业阶段获得一定收入</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2236">00:37:16</a>在IT圈自然而然打造声望</span></p></blockquote><p><span>写在最后：</span></p><p><span>（敲黑板）慎重理财投资！！两人一致认为：投资得先做好专业功课。</span></p><p><span>有一句非常简单的话，你想想你多么辛苦、用了半年一年才赚了10万块，但你去投资的时候只用了几天、几小时甚至几分钟，这是不是有一点不合理。</span></p><p><span>祝各位客官听的开心，活的长久一点~</span></p><p><span>欢迎留言一起聊天！~(≧▽≦)/~</span></p><p><span>OP：Jambalaya-Carpenters</span></p><p><span>ED：Comment Te Dire Adieu?</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgvVlPfEZg3xeocMjMFng2Z2sOXI.m4a" length="69927377" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqrLcqlJxKU0P0aQnhjlZo_6Hi9x.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>006 外贸小白的广交会之旅|从展位到销售</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665472a14efbc0c3dc64c536</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665472a14efbc0c3dc64c536</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 May 2024 11:46:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>毕业后打算从事外贸的入门小白一枚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一去广交会！兴奋、激动、期待！但是出发遇到暴雨!听说还有洪水！回来也是极端天气！龙卷风！冰雹！火车停靠有一小时半！真像历险记！</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为供应商参展。从准备展位、跟着学接待客户，到参展的疲惫、销售过程积累的点点滴滴，以及依葫芦画瓢做sales的成就感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>为您带来这场全球最大展会的前线报道（小白版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="607">00:10:07</a> 布展：拆箱、摆放、点亮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">00:12:07</a> 酒店的杂粮早餐，半小时公交到达展会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">00:14:10</a> 浙商实力：彩灯、汽车零部件和卫浴出口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">00:18:13</a> OEM模式的供应商</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">00:27:38</a> 真实场景下的语言交流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">00:33:11</a> 硬技术是生意的基石，英语沟通能力才是外贸上限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">00:38:44</a> 业内著名的印度采购手段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">00:49:50</a> 被一位欧洲采购实习生夸了哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3321">00:55:21</a> 如何识别客户和判断客户类别？</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：Sofia - Alvaro Soler</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：Daydream By Design - Gaby Moreno</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq6vN9yl3UpB9usixkrHTHoOKOTx.m4a" length="96457523" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:30</itunes:duration>
