  <item>
    <title>005 性、谎言和录像带 | 一部有着心理学韵味的独立电影</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66423a952e74bb361ea3a7ae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66423a952e74bb361ea3a7ae</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 May 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>🎥《性、谎言和录像带》</span></h2><h2><span>本期灵感来源于非常喜欢的这部电影，索德伯格的处女作，但一经发布就获得了戛纳金棕榈奖。非常简洁舒服，但又可以说是非常“性感”的电影！</span></h2><h2><br></h2><h2><span>🎙：</span></h2><h2><span>「蔷薇少女」:</span></h2><h2><span>-心理学总是让人如此的着迷~</span></h2><h2><span>「梻幂」</span></h2><h2><span>-性心理学探索者</span></h2><h2><span>-都很爱男主这个角色！</span></h2><h2><br></h2><h2><span>Timeline：</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">05:04</a>谈话开场炸弹“我性无能”，却带来直接粗暴的性魅力</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a>将私密之事公之于众，会有一种隐秘的刺激感</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>性无能反而是吸引女主的“毒药”</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a> Q：“我和她相比，谁更有魅力?”A：“just different ”</span></h2><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2846">47:26</a> 你要是能跳到剧里面，跟两位女主说“you always have choices” 那该多好呀！</span></h2><h2><br></h2><h2><span>惬意的聊聊天～</span></h2><h2><br></h2><h2><span>🎵BGM：</span></h2><h2><span>这次没有BGM了，纯聊天~</span></h2>]]></description>
